"Signing…" = "署名中…";
"“%@” is ready to send" = "「%@」を送信する準備ができました";
"Sync through iCloud Drive" = "iCloud Driveで同期";
"Last sync" = "最終同期";
"Testing…" = "テスト中…";
"Writes a small file into the folder and reads it back" = "フォルダに小さなファイルを書き込み、読み返します";
"Open in Finder" = "Finderで開く";
"iPhone Shortcuts" = "iPhoneのショートカット";
